WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,300 --> 00:00:03,300
Senior, is this really useful?

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,930
I don't know. It depends on luck.

3
00:00:07,930 --> 00:00:08,930
We have nothing now

4
00:00:08,930 --> 00:00:10,930
It's too hard to hunt them

5
00:00:10,930 --> 00:00:11,930
But just dig a big hole

6
00:00:11,930 --> 00:00:13,930
Then they accidentally fall down

7
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:14,930
I can't run away

8
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:15,930
Dig a hole first

9
00:00:15,930 --> 00:00:17,930
This cow is enough for us to eat for a long, long time

10
00:00:17,930 --> 00:00:19,930
Even if it takes a long time, it'll be okay

11
00:00:19,930 --> 00:00:23,460
After digging the hole

12
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,460
I'm taking a long detour

13
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,460
Go around to the back of the herd

14
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,460
Drive them this way

15
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:27,460
Niu Rendi was frightened

16
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:29,460
He will only run to places he is familiar with

17
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:30,460
This place is full of their imprints

18
00:00:30,460 --> 00:00:31,460
Most likely they will escape this way

19
00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:33,460
All it takes is a bison to get trapped in the mine

20
00:00:33,460 --> 00:00:34,460
We sent it

21
00:00:36,520 --> 00:00:38,520
Give you 3 hours of time during the day

22
00:00:39,900 --> 00:00:41,900
Wow time flies so fast

23
00:00:41,900 --> 00:00:43,900
There are still 3 hours left
